    "created_at": "2022-12-15T10:53:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-15T10:53:48Z",
    "body": "Is 'step' in general confusing, or only where history algorithms also deal with algorithm steps? We could always call them 'algorithm steps'.\r\n\r\nOr the history concept of 'step' could be renamed to something like 'position'.",
