    "created_at": "2022-12-15T12:29:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-15T12:30:22Z",
    "body": "\"step\" is confusing because it is used in so many different places meaning totally different things with session history.\r\nI haven't ever considered \"step\" being confusing in spec algorithms in general.\r\n\r\n\"position\" or \"session history position\" or some such might help.",
